                                                "text": "Never stood a chance. The poor fucker was cooked."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f12570df-1922-4516-aa34-23aa329280e1",
                                                "sense_id": "d5a181d5-3d1d-3560-80c9-d8727a726941",
                                                "text": "It’s easy to get reflective after a few brunchtime cocktails. “Was I one of these little fuckers?” Savannah Engel wondered aloud to me one Sunday after Bloody Marys at Cafe Cluny."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
